  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはよう──今週はどんなお話だ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009010020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あっ、これは再放送なんです！\r\nほら、この怪人……！　見覚えありませんかっ！？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900901/2009009010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009010030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "この後、怪人が高笑いしたら、 \r\nレッドが登場するんです……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900901/2009009010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、すっかり覚えちゃってるじゃないか\r\n何度見ても飽きないんだなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009010040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "もちろんですっ！\r\n何度見てもカッコいいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200900901/2009009010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2009009010050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ヒーローは小さいころからずーっと…… \r\nあたしのあこがれです……！",
